//- Parameters:
//-   field          {String}  data-field attribute value               (default: 'phone')
//-   value          {String}  initial phone value e.g "+507 6234-5678" (default: '')
//-   defaultCountry {String}  ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 country code          (default: 'PA')
//-   disabled       {Boolean} makes the picker read-only               (default: false)

